00:00:33.539 --> 00:00:37.720
Just looking at cases in Nebraska, the curve
is spiking.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.920
It's not good.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.649
It's a terrible idea to continue holding these
rallies.

00:00:41.649 --> 00:00:47.660
This one was packed with reportedly 6000 people
shoulder to shoulder, very few masks.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.440
Even the people on stage behind Trump widely
not wearing masks.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.460
