00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:55.499
But there were 6000 people.

00:00:55.499 --> 00:00:59.460
And that's way too many for when you have
a global hundred year pandemic.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.389
But that's the case at every rally.

00:01:01.389 --> 00:01:07.460
Last night there was the added humiliation
for Donald Trump, which was that it was cold.

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.659
And Donald Trump wrapped up quickly, actually,
one of the shortest rallies he's given in

00:01:11.659 --> 00:01:14.439
