00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:23.579
The temperature dropped to nearly freezing.

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:28.719
Rally goers started lining up to get their
bus rides back to their parking lots for miles

00:01:28.719 --> 00:01:30.020
